			"notes": "Fixes a resource reload failure that could leave Minecraft's window black at startup on 1.21.9 through 26.2, before connecting to an Armature server.\n\nThe armor renderer now passes the atlas definition ID (`minecraft:armor_trims`) to `AtlasManager`, instead of the old texture path (`minecraft:textures/atlas/armor_trims.png`). Minecraft 1.21.8 retains its existing atlas lookup. The fix does not require a server plugin update.\n\nAn added regression test compares Armature's armor atlas lookup with vanilla equipment rendering in each exact Minecraft target. It fails against the previous implementation and passes with this fix. All eight targets pass 76 headless tests, build their JARs, and compile gametests. Visual startup and Iris checks remain to be confirmed in game.\n\nChoose the runtime JAR matching your exact Minecraft version. Source JARs are excluded; source code is available in the repository and GitHub source archives."
		},
